        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>BAL-WES-TAR, Baldwin Westcliff Entry Set</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAvailable in a single, double, or dummy cylinder function, the Westcliff Entrance Set is part of Baldwin's Reserve Collection. As such, it has a 25 year finish warranty and a lifetime manufacturer warranty. Choose from  beautiful finishes including satin nickel (pictured) as well as polished brass. The Westcliff Arched Handleset has matching arched interior trim, just select one of 3 available knobs or 3 levers. Made to fit in standard pre-drilled doors, this entryset fits doors with thicknesses of 1-3/8 inches to 2-1/2 inches. It has an adjustable latch for backsets of 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Baldwin WES-TAR Westcliff Traditional Handleset with Matching Arched Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Fits 2-1/8\" cross bore for both deadbolt and grip with a 1\" edge bore for both grip latch and deadbolt latch.</li>\r\n<li>Baldwin C-Keyway.</li>\r\n<li>Latch: square corner adjustable</li>\r\n<li>Strike: square corner</li>\r\n<li>Brass deadbolt features 1\" throw. Grip offers 1/2\" passage/privacy function bolt.</li>\r\n<li>Deadbolt tested to exceed ANSI-BHMA Grade 2 Security.</li>\r\n<li>Warranty: 25 year finish warranty and a limited lifetime mechanical warranty.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Baldwin Classic Arched Westcliff Entryset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Exterior Deadbolt Width: 2-11/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Deadbolt Length: 3-7/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Deadbolt Width: 2-11/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Deadbolt Length: 3-1/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Single Cylinder Interior Deadbolt Projection: 1-7/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Double Cylinder Interior Deadbolt Projection: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Handleset Length (without deadbolt): 12-1/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Handleset Length center to center (without deadbolt): 8-13/32\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Grip Projection: 3-1/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Trim Rose Width: 2-21/32\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Trim Rose Length: 3-7/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness Standard: 1-3/4\" - 2\" </li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness Optional:  1-3/8\" - 1-3/4\" or 2\" - 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: Adjustable for 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Westcliff Entrance Set with Arched interior Trim Rose, Baldwin WES-TAR",
                "description": "Available in a single, double, or dummy cylinder function, the Westcliff Entrance Set is part of Baldwin's Reserve Collection. As such, it has a 25 year finish warranty and a lifetime manufacturer warranty. Choose from  beautiful finishes including satin nickel (pictured) as well as polished brass. The Westcliff Arched Handleset has matching arched interior trim, just select one of 3 available knobs or 3 levers. Made to fit in standard pre-drilled doors, this entryset fits doors with thicknesses of 1-3/8 inches to 2-1/2 inches. It has an adjustable latch for backsets of 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches.\r\n",
                "keywords": "BAL-WES-TAR, Arched Westcliff Handlesets, Baldwin WES-TAR, Westcliff Entrance Sets, traditional entry sets, classic entry sets, traditional front door entry sets, baldwin reserve collection entrance trim sets, grade 2 handlesets, single cylinder handlesets, double cylinder handlesets, dummy handlesets,  Westcliff Entrance Set with Arched interior Trim Roses,  Baldwin Westcliff Entry Sets, Westcliff Traditional Handleset with Matching Arched Roses, Baldwin Classic Arched Westcliff Entrysets,"
